<p>Mehsoos kare koi to, dil kaap uthega<br> sailaab e ghamo dard hai, roke na rukega<br> khud kaatib e taqdeer basad dard likhega<br> maqtal ki zamee'n roegi, zindaan kahega<br> Pardes hai ghurbat hai, (barabar ki thakan hai)..(2)<br> Abbas sa bhai hai to, (zainab si bahan hai)..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Ek saniye zehra hai, to ek saniye haider<br> shabbir ka ek bhai hai, (aur ek hai khwahar)..(2)<br> Hai boodhe ali bhai , (bahan rashke chaman hai)..(2)<br> Pardes....</p> 
<p>2. Ek zamine chadar hai, sabhi ehle haram ka<br> aur ek ki rida dhoop mein, (saaya hai alam ka)..(2)<br> ek dharas e shabbir hai, (ek qalb e hasan hai)..(2)<br> Pardes....</p> 
<p>3. Dono ne wafao'n ka, bharam aise rakha hai<br> ye hukm ka paband wo, (paband e haya hai)..(2)<br> ek tashna e paykar hai, (ek tashna dahan hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>4. Dono hi alamdaar e wafa hai sare maidaa'n<br> ye asr se pehle wo, (pase shaame ghareeba'n)..(2)<br> kaapa huwa sehma hua, (dono se hi rann hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>5. Ek majlis o matam ki, bena daalne wali<br> ek baad e shahadat bhi hai, (maidaan ka ghaazi)..(2)<br> ek hai bani hashim ka qamar, (ek kiran hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>6. Bazu the bandhe sar tha, khula jab ke behan ka<br> be bazu alamdaar tha, (mohtaj kafan ka)..(2)<br> dono ke kalejo me, (musalsal ye chubhan hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>7. Wo barsare naiza tha, ye kaa'nto pe rawa thi<br> sar uska gira naize se, (ye mehwe fugha thi)..(2)<br> ye khoon ki taseer hai, (rishto ki lagan hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>8. Abbas ki ik aankh mein jab teer chubha tha<br> dil thaam ke zainab ne, (basad dard kaha tha)..(2)<br> majboor hu bhaiyya mere, (haatho'n me rasan hai)..(2)<br> Pardes...</p> 
<p>9. Rehan o raza zainab o ghaazi ki dua hai<br> wallah ye shehzaadi, (sakina ki ataa hai)..(2)<br> is nauhe me taaeed e (shehenshahe zaman hai)..(2)</p> 
<p>Pardes hai ghurbat hai, (barabar ki thakan hai)..(2)<br> Abbas sa bhai hai to, (zainab si bahan hai)..(2)</p>